  "description": "This  planning application is largely the same as those of P/2025/3344 and P/2026/1570, which were approved in 2026. The conversion of the house from flats back to its original status as a single-family dwelling, with Lower Ground floor rear extension and all other minor amendments,  has already been approved under P/2025/3344. \n\nThe application seeks minor amendments to those approvals: \n1.\tWe propose to create a wider permeable platform in the front garden, for dedicated bin and bike storage, that makes more of a front garden like other houses on the street\n2.\tWe propose to add a Conservation rooflight to the side hipped roof, and increase the height of the rear second floor windows.\n\n\n",
